  "title": "US Supreme Court Upholds Mail-In Voting in Midterm Elections, Addressing Voter Access Concerns",
  "summary": "The US Supreme Court upheld its decision to allow mail-in voting in midterms, following a federal judge’s earlier decision to block new limits, while the Trump administration faces legal challenges over its stance. The court continues to oppose restrictions on the process, and the ruling comes on the eve of pivotal midterm elections.",
